<title>USA: New Prague, Minn., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</title>
<headline>New Prague, Minn., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juran &amp; Moody said it won $1.100 million of New Prague, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.010 percent.</p>
</text>
